  "title": "Design an assertion-focused audit program",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Design an assertion-focused audit program</h2><p>Choose the best procedure for each identified inventory and revenue risk.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs1-f1\">Procedure for A</label><select id=\"aud-m3-tbs1-f1\"><option value=\"Vouch recorded items to physical inventory\">Vouch recorded items to physical inventory</option><option value=\"Trace only unrecorded orders\">Trace only unrecorded orders</option><option value=\"Inspect only payroll approvals\">Inspect only payroll approvals</option><option value=\"Confirm the auditor’s bank balance\">Confirm the auditor’s bank balance</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs1-f2\">Procedure for B</label><select id=\"aud-m3-tbs1-f2\"><option value=\"Trace shipping documents to sales records\">Trace shipping documents to sales records</option><option value=\"Select only recorded sales\">Select only recorded sales</option><option value=\"Inspect only the chart of accounts\">Inspect only the chart of accounts</option><option value=\"Review dividend approvals\">Review dividend approvals</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs1-f3\">Assertion for C</label><select id=\"aud-m3-tbs1-f3\"><option value=\"Rights and obligations\">Rights and obligations</option><option value=\"Audit fee classification\">Audit fee classification</option><option value=\"Only arithmetic accuracy\">Only arithmetic accuracy</option><option value=\"No assertion\">No assertion</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs1-f4\">Assertion for D</label><select id=\"aud-m3-tbs1-f4\"><option value=\"Cutoff\">Cutoff</option><option value=\"Only existence of the warehouse\">Only existence of the warehouse</option><option value=\"Only audit documentation retention\">Only audit documentation retention</option><option value=\"No reporting-period issue\">No reporting-period issue</option></select></div></section>",
