  "explanation": "<h3>Procedure for A</h3><p>Vouching recorded quantities to goods addresses existence.</p><h3>Procedure for B</h3><p>Tracing an independent source population addresses omitted transactions.</p><h3>Assertion for C</h3><p>Consigned goods may be physically present but not owned.</p><h3>Assertion for D</h3><p>January activity recognized in December misstates the reporting period.</p>"
